OL,3,AAustralian MP has critical injuries
OL,4,Aafter being hit by car in what PM calls
OL,5,A'deliberate act'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian MP Helen Haines has been hit
OL,8,Fby a car in what Prime Minister Anthony
OL,9,FAlbanese calls "a deliberate act"
OL,11,FPolice say Haines has "critical
OL,12,Finjuries" and they're investigating
OL,13,Fwhether it was "intentional" - here's
OL,14,Ftheir statement in full
OL,16,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,17,FTarrawingee, was detained at the scene
OL,18,Fby a passer-by before being taken into
OL,19,Fcustody
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
