OL,6,
OL,7,FHaines was struck near her regional
OL,8,Foffice in Wangaratta, Victoria - her
OL,9,Ffamily thank "the swift assistance of
OL,10,Fbystanders"
OL,12,FThe 65-year-old MP was taken by
OL,13,Fhelicopter to hospital in Melbourne
